    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ya̱c mi̱eth riɛm",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Kuoth Nhial Muthɛ jiök i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ruacni kɛ Ä-ron kɛnɛ gaatkɛ, kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal jiök nikɛ i̱, ‘Nɛmɛ ɛ jɛn min ci Kuoth ɛ lar i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "raan I-thɛ-rɛl ɔ bi mucdɛ thöp rɛy wec kiɛ jɔk wec ɔ, yaŋ rɔaam kiɛ böw, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a /kenɛ jɛ nööŋ thok kɛmɛkä ro̱mä kɛ Kuoth Nhial ala muc mi thöpɛ Kuoth Nhial nhiam luaak Kuɔth, ɛn raam ɔ cɛ duer kɛ wuth riɛm piny. Kä ba tuɔ̱k raar rɛy nɛɛnikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikɛ ɣöö bi ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl muckiɛn tin na̱kɛ rɛy ka̱a̱ni dɔɔr nöŋ Kuoth Nhial, bikɛ jɛ nöŋ bööth palä thok kɛmɛkä ro̱mä kɛ Kuoth Nhial, kä bɛ kɛ thöp ala muc malä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi bööth palä riɛm kiɛth yi̱kä Kuɔth Nhial min te thok kɛmɛkä ro̱mä kɛ Kuoth Nhial, kä bɛ thiɔl waŋ ala ŋuäny mi gɔaa kä Kuoth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ci ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl bi lɛ ŋot kɛ mi thöpkɛ muc deetkiɛn kuth, tin palkɛn kɛ. Ɛn mɛmɛ ba jɛn ŋut mi do̱raar kä kɛ amäni ri̱c ɛ bi ben ɔ.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä jiök nikɛ, pëkdɛ raan I-thɛ-rɛl kiɛ juɔ̱r ɛ cieŋ rɛydiɛn ɔ mɔ bi luurɛ min waŋkɛ kiɛ muc thöp ɔ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä /kenɛ jɛ nööŋ thok kɛmɛkä ro̱mä kɛ Kuoth Nhial a bɛ jɛ ben thöp Kuoth Nhial, ɛn raam ɔ ba jɛ tuɔ̱k raar rɛy nɛɛnikɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä mi wee tekɛ raan I-thɛ-rɛl kiɛ juɔ̱r mi wä riɛm cam, bä wi̱cdä luɔ̱c ɛn raam ɔ ci riɛm camɔ, kä bä jɛ tuɔ̱k raar kä nɛɛkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö te tëk ri̱ŋ rɛy riɛm. Cä ka̱m yɛ i̱ bia rɔ luɛl kɛ jɛ wi̱i̱ yi̱kä, ɛ jɛn riɛm luɛl yi̱ey tɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ Kui̱ ɛmɔ cä la̱r ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ɛn ɣöö thilɛ ram mi bi riɛm cam, amäni jur tin cieŋ rɛydiɛn thilɛ ram mi bi riɛm cam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi wä raan I-thɛ-rɛl, kiɛ ram mi juɔ̱r kä jur tɔ̱ cieŋ rɛydiɛn tɔ̱ le̱y kiɛ dit wä kak, kä tin dɔ̱ŋ dëë cam, a jɛ wuth riɛmdɛ piny kä bɛ jɛ mol kɛ tup.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ ɣöö tëk kä ti diaal te rɛy riɛmdɛ, kɛ ɣöö nɔ cä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl jiök i̱ /ca riɛm bi cam rɛy ri̱ŋ, kɛ ɣöö tëk ri̱ŋ ɛ riɛm, kä ram ɔ biɛ cam ɔ ba tuɔ̱k raar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn ram ɔ bi ri̱ŋ lɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ mi ci li̱w kä rɔa kiɛ ca näk ɛ le̱y mi dɔ̱ŋ cam ɔ kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kiɛ kä jur, a jɛ lak bieynikɛ kä a jɛ puaak, bɛ jiääk mäni thiaŋ, kɛ kɔrɛ bɛ cu gɔaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi wec tey a /cɛ bieynikɛ lak kä /cɛ puaak bɛ riɛkdɛ jëk ɛ jɛn.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
